The <span style="color: #38C538;">Avrizan Peasants’ League</span> serves as the nucleus of the federal <span style="color: #007A00;">Commonwealth Peasants' Party</span> and is surprisingly liberal and <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> compared to other agricultural parties and organizations, such as the <span style="color: #7FCEB1;">**CNBLP**</span>. Recently, they even exited the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>'s cabinet over a dispute about taxes. [? if concord_formed: <br><br> With the formation of the <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span>, the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>'s Avrizan branch has largely merged into the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>, although some elements have instead chosen to align with the <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>. ?]
